    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d387">

                <pb facs="0520" n="440" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg440"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to the minister for foreign affairs of
                        Portugal.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September 17,
                            1901</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>In the names of Mrs. McKinley and of President Roosevelt I am directed to ask
                    your excellency to convey to His Majesty sincere appreciation felt by the
                    President and the American nation for His Majesty’s messages of condolence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
